  "description": "MUJLUC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H46 Cl12 N13 O18 Tb3,x(C2 H6 O1),y(C4 H10 O1),z(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.962-5.256 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 165.82-176.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C54H43Cl12N13O18Tb3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
